id: pm-2x5x83
title: Tracker-only PM governance commits cannot satisfy required CI without changing the generated changelog
description: "The required static CI lane runs changelog:pm:check against every push. A deliberately tracker-only audit that closes PM items changes the generated changelog input, so exact-head CI fails unless the session also edits CHANGELOG.md, contradicting a valid PM-only/no-docs scope and making direct tracker governance unable to produce a green required-check set."
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 1
tags[5]: agent-workflow,"area:ci",changelog,governance,tracker-only
created_at: "2026-08-04T09:41:11.527Z"
updated_at: "2026-08-04T12:24:59.621Z"
closed_at: "2026-08-04T12:24:58.939Z"
completed_at: "2026-08-04T12:24:58.939Z"
author: "harness:codex"
estimated_minutes: 120
acceptance_criteria: "Decide and document whether tracker-only closed-item mutations must always regenerate CHANGELOG.md or may be classified outside product changelog inputs; CI, contributor guidance, pm-changelog generation, and auto-release change classification share one explicit contract; a clean fixture proves a tracker-only planning commit can follow that contract without an empty npm/Bun release; a negative control proves a product-visible closed item still fails when its generated changelog is stale; direct-main and PR paths report the same policy; regression evidence references an exact source SHA and generated artifact diff; no manual CHANGELOG edits are introduced"
parent: pm-u9d0
risk: medium
confidence: high
severity: high
environment: GitHub Actions main push at 9d28e08b96b1caa36d41e68ef82e09ebb2e46c78
repro_steps: "Commit only append-only .agents/pm planning and evidence changes that close a PM item; push to main; observe CI run 30897051387 job 91952524714 fail in Run static + secret + version gates because pnpm changelog:pm:check reports CHANGELOG.md out of date."
resolution: Release relevance now separates tracker source history and generated changelog projections from package-relevant changes.
expected_result: A tracker-only PM governance commit has an explicit policy path that preserves generated changelog ownership and still yields an honest required-check result without requiring an out-of-scope docs mutation or empty product release.
actual_result: "Tracker-only plus generated CHANGELOG.md changes skip auto-release; any product/test/docs/workflow path remains release-relevant, preserving the daily release and publication gates."
component: CI and changelog governance
