comments[6]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-04T09:41:11.527Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check 2026-08-04: searched every status for tracker-only commit, changelog out-of-date, generated changelog governance, direct-main, and changelog drag. Existing pm-6san defines generated ownership, pm-pivf owns a specific GH-209 warning cleanup, and pm-u9d0 owns CI/release capability; no active or terminal item owns the general required-check policy conflict reproduced on exact head. This item is the focused canonical owner."
  "2026-08-04T09:41:30.260Z","harness:codex","Hosted evidence: exact-head CI run https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/actions/runs/30897051387, static job https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/actions/runs/30897051387/job/91952524714. The job checked out 9d28e08b96b1caa36d41e68ef82e09ebb2e46c78 and failed with Changelog is out of date after successfully installing pm-changelog 2026.8.4. This audit does not regenerate CHANGELOG.md because the user explicitly limited mutations to PM planning/documentation; the failure is preserved as policy evidence, not repaired in this session."
  "2026-08-04T09:41:57.367Z","harness:codex","Exact-head hosted inventory is complete: Security and Script Quality, OSSF Scorecard, CodSpeed, and CodeQL all succeeded on 9d28e08b96b1caa36d41e68ef82e09ebb2e46c78. CI completed with 13 successful jobs and exactly one failed job, Gates (static) 91952524714; the failing step was changelog:pm:check reporting only that CHANGELOG.md was out of date. This isolates the policy conflict from product build, typecheck, compatibility, smoke, coverage, Windows, benchmark, and security outcomes."
  "2026-08-04T11:47:39.693Z","harness:codex","Evidence: release relevance now ignores only .agents/pm/** plus generated CHANGELOG.md, with product paths as the negative control; daily release guards and npm publication checks remain covered. Linked release tests passed; direct pm-changelog 2026.8.4 check passed; only one v2026.8.4 release exists today; npm and Bun packed consumers plus npx/bunx execution passed; audit and secret scan are clean."
  "2026-08-04T11:52:05.152Z","harness:codex","Review handoff: PR #893 https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/pull/893 at initial head 6c31a5f18 packages this item with the related SDK/CLI governance tranche."
  "2026-08-04T12:24:57.738Z","harness:codex","Final review evidence: PR #893 exact head a8ea2b426 passed every hosted check, including static, 4 coverage shards plus coverage gate, typecheck, compatibility, smokes, Windows, benchmarks, CodeQL, Semgrep, Trivy, TruffleHog, ShellCheck, PSScriptAnalyzer, actionlint, DeepScan, CodeFactor, Codecov, and CodSpeed. Sourcery's actionable flag-normalization thread was implemented/replied/resolved; all bot comments/reviews were reacted to and acknowledged. CodeRabbit was quota-limited and Greptile supplied no response within the review window."
learnings[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-04T11:47:55.173Z","harness:codex","Release relevance should classify source inputs, not generated projections: tracker history plus its generated changelog must not manufacture a package release, while any product path remains a fail-safe negative control."
